# Scower settings
#
# Paste each key right after its = sign (no spaces, no quotes), save the file
# (Ctrl+S), and close it. Then restart Scower: close its window and double-click
# start.cmd (or run `npm start`). Every key is optional: Scower uses whichever
# sources have a key and skips the rest. See README.md for where to get each one.

# --- Google Lens, Google Shopping and eBay (start with this one) -------------
# Finds the photo across the web: Grailed, StockX, Depop, Poshmark, Mercari,
# GOAT, eBay, brand stores and more. Free plan (250 searches a month) at
# https://serpapi.com. Each photo search uses 4 SerpApi searches
# (2 Google Lens + 1 Google Shopping + 1 eBay), so about 60 photo searches a month.
SERPAPI_KEY=

# --- AI item identification (recommended, pay per use) ---------------------
# Works out exactly what's in the photo (brand, model, colorway) and checks
# which listings are really that item. Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- eBay's own search (optional) ---------------------------------------------
# eBay is already searched through SERPAPI_KEY. These keys add eBay's search by
# photo and save one SerpApi search per photo. Free developer account at
# https://developer.ebay.com -> Application Keys -> create a Production keyset,
# then copy the App ID (Client ID) and Cert ID (Client Secret).
EBAY_CLIENT_ID=
EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=


# ===========================================================================
# Optional settings. Most people never need these. Remove the # at the start
# of a line to use it.
# ===========================================================================

# Web address port. Change it if another program already uses 3000.
# PORT=3000

# Photos are uploaded to SerpApi for Google Lens. If that upload fails while
# Scower runs on your own computer, it falls back to litterbox.catbox.moe
# (deleted automatically after 1 hour). Set to "off" to turn that fallback off.
# TEMP_IMAGE_HOST=litterbox

# Search eBay through SerpApi when there are no eBay keys (1 SerpApi search per photo).
# SERPAPI_EBAY=on

# Country for Google results and prices (two-letter code).
# SEARCH_COUNTRY=us

# eBay site to search.
# EBAY_MARKETPLACE=EBAY_US

# Claude model used for identification and match checking.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# --- Only needed if you put Scower online (Render, Railway, Fly...) ----------

# The site's public address, if Google Lens can't reach uploaded photos.
# PUBLIC_URL=https://your-site.example.com

# Max searches per visitor per 10 minutes.
# SEARCH_RATE_LIMIT=30

# Number of reverse proxies in front of the app (for correct visitor IPs).
# TRUST_PROXY=1

# Network address to listen on. Defaults to all addresses, or only this
# computer when started with start.cmd / --open.
# HOST=0.0.0.0
